{"steam_appid":3205080,"steam_name":"Bad Parenting 1: Mr. Red Face","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3205080/748709/0224e6e29c4b5b833687a2ced3aa59da1f17ece8/1750824757/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1725905388","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257051011/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1725905388","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/ss_81d0f42e158a1a929fb75bd868fa79c824d0fafa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1739082924","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/ss_46e7cc9b3ae7ed0daac171b2f256505ec2b931b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1739082924","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/ss_e285e15117899658b9c0cb7b3af0e57cf0729707.1920x1080.jpg?t=1739082924","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/ss_e9804e3a5396fbc534a5cdf68138d25a5fedeb92.1920x1080.jpg?t=1739082924","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/ss_e2bd2394657eef3d62a760bde3a3ea4953939e83.1920x1080.jpg?t=1739082924"],"about_the_game":"<strong>What's new in the Steam version?</strong><br>Added Fanart Exhibition, a 3D environment decorated with your fanart. You can walk freely in this environment.<br>Added <strong>4</strong> different graphic filters and brightness setting.<br><br><strong>Story</strong>: Mr. Red Face, a fictional character created by adults to teach their children. It's said that he often appears late at night to give gifts to well-behaved kids. But is the story of Mr. Red Face really that simple?<br>The game takes place in a small apartment where Ron, the game's protagonist, face terrifying supernatural phenomena and at the same time try to protect his family from the red-faced man's evil plans.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/extras/7f26272733e47a818ac9639ab8780dc8.poster.avif?t=1739082924\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/extras/7f26272733e47a818ac9639ab8780dc8.webm?t=1739082924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/extras/7f26272733e47a818ac9639ab8780dc8.mp4?t=1739082924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Bad Parenting is a linear game that delves into psychological and supernatural elements. The graphic style is based on old 90s cartoons, which will give you a nostalgic experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/extras/3876d3acf791ced437472aac09f1e6be.poster.avif?t=1739082924\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/extras/3876d3acf791ced437472aac09f1e6be.webm?t=1739082924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/extras/3876d3acf791ced437472aac09f1e6be.mp4?t=1739082924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains disturbing scenes that may trigger your childhood trauma.<br><strong>Average duration</strong>: ~30 minutes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/extras/8ff4b2f4efdd807daebef7919c46a12b.poster.avif?t=1739082924\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/extras/8ff4b2f4efdd807daebef7919c46a12b.webm?t=1739082924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205080/extras/8ff4b2f4efdd807daebef7919c46a12b.mp4?t=1739082924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 3220<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 650 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 3770<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8.192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 650 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["2OO2","VN"],"publishers":["2OO2"],"release_date":"9 Oct, 2024"}